From e72b5cf68c425f06ce29bc2db6792f5831ad43d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bezko <bezkom@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:55:13 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Cycle strip mute points Main/AllPoints.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Ctrl+click Mute toggles MuteMaster Main↔AllPoints; M·All badge.
--smoke-mute-points: Main → AllPoints → Main (Dummy exit 0).
---
